{'symbol': 'YUM', 'date': '2023-03-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'DOUBLE THE FRIED CHICKEN. DOUBLE THE CHEESE.', 'text': 'AFTER A NEARLY 10-YEAR HIATUS, THE ICONIC KFC®\xa0DOUBLE DOWN IS BACK – AND FOR THOSE UNSURE ABOUT LEAVING BEHIND THE BUNS, KFC IS ALSO INTRODUCING A NEW BACON & CHEESE CHICKEN SANDWICH LOUISVILLE, KY. , MARCH 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOR THE FIRST TIME IN NEARLY A DECADE,\xa0KENTUCKY FRIED CHICKEN® IS BRINGING BACK A MENU ITEM WITH A CULT FOLLOWING LIKE NONE OTHER, THE KFC DOUBLE DOWN SANDWICH.'}